q13.body:
Krevo has **not been audited**. Before any real value can ever touch it, the cryptography and the consensus rules need independent eyes.

[docs/SECURITY.md](https://github.com/Milkausikopistor/krevo/blob/main/docs/SECURITY.md) is the starting point: threat model, where the security-critical code lives and how to reproduce every check. The most valuable areas:
- full-chain membership proofs: curve tree, circuit and Bulletproofs (`src/fcmp/`, `rust/krevod/src/fcmp.rs`);
- range proofs, CLSAG, balance signature and the private-pool turnstile;
- the constant-time wallet vault and secret handling (`rust/krevod/src/vault.rs`, `wallet_ops.rs`, `ct.rs`, `field.rs`);
- the hybrid Schnorr + ML-DSA-44 quantum-safe addresses;
- consensus edge cases where the JavaScript and Rust nodes could diverge.

Non-sensitive findings and questions: open an issue. Anything that could be exploited: please report it privately first.
